# RESULTS_TRUST — SGCC trustworthy layer (post-hoc, NREP=20)

Pre-reg: PLAN_TRUST_2026-06-02.md. Conformal: split-APS within each
held-out fold (stratified calib/test), 20 repeats averaged per cell.
